class_name Bodies
extends RefCounted
## Hand-drawn body rigs (see Rig for the character key). Each body is one base frame;
## its animation frames come from pixel-safe transforms of that frame (squash removes a
## middle row and widens by duplicating the center column, stretch does the reverse,
## lift raises it off the ground, lean pushes the upper half forward), which is how a
## pixel artist builds a slime bounce by hand. "foot" is the ground pivot.
## "ramp" is the default color ramp; the player's ramp changes as it evolves.

